import LOEIS.A378.A378107.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A378107

Lexicographically earliest sequence of distinct positive integers such that for any n > 0, either a(n+1) is a multiple of a(n) or the decimal expansion of a(n+1) appears in that of a(n).

The 62 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A378107

/-- Known terms of `A378107`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 6, 12, 24, 48, 96,
    9, 18, 36, 3, 15, 5, 10, 20, 40, 80,
    160, 60, 120, 240, 480, 960, 1920, 19, 38, 76,
